SUMMARY:Many Moons Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate community\, creativity\, and Asian American and Pacific Islander cultures at the 2026 Many Moons Festival\, presented by AAPIC North Bay. This welcoming\, family-friendly festival brings together live entertainment\, cultural performances and demonstrations\, food and beverages\, artists\, makers and marketplace vendors\, wellness and community organizations\, and interactive activities for children and teens. Festivalgoers can also experience the Under Many Moons art exhibit and connect with the diverse people\, traditions\, and stories that make the North Bay vibrant. \nMany Moons Festival takes place Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\, from 11:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. at Ives Park in Sebastopol\, California. Advance tickets are $10; admission is $15 at the gate; children 12 and under attend free. For the latest schedule\, ticket information\, transportation details\, accessibility information\, and festival updates\, visit manymoonsfestival.com.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/many-moons-festival-2/
LOCATION:Ives Park\, 7400 Willow St.\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Business,Celebration,Crafting,Dance,Entertainment/Culture,Festivals,Food & Drink,History/Culture,LGBTQI,Music,Shopping,Volunteer Opportunity,Wine
