SUMMARY:Psychic Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Psychic Fair is back! \nAs per usual\, we will have readings\, book signings\, hourly raffle prizes\, and a whole lotta witchy fun! \nThe event starts at NOON\, all tarot readings will be 10 minutes and cost $20. Readings will end at 6pm\, so don’t wait too long to get in line! \nTickets for readings can be purchased at Milk & Honey the day of the event. There is no limit to the amount of readings you can get! Try out as many readers as you’d like. \nCome on by and get your Samhain energy going. Feel free to bring a picture or memento of your Beloved Dead for our Ancestor Altar.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/psychic-fair/
LOCATION:Milk and Honey\, 123 N. Main Street\, SEBASTOPOL\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/MH-Psychic-Fair-5.jpg
