SUMMARY:Tea Tasting - Organic or Non? Can you tell the difference?
DESCRIPTION:Does organic production influence the taste of tea? Our October tea tasting\, conducted by Grady Kallenbach\, will offer a blind head-to-head challenge/ comparison of organic and conventional versions of three popular Japanese teas: kukicha\, genmaicha\, and hojicha. The audience will candidly hold forth on the qualities of each\, with no foreknowledge of which version is being tasted. Be prepared to enjoy conviviality without consensus!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/tea-tasting-organic-or-non-can-you-tell-the-difference/
LOCATION:Many Rivers Books & Tea\, 130 S. Main St.\, Suite 101\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/some-Japanese-greens.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Many Rivers Books and Tea":MAILTO:info@manyriversbooks.com
END:VEVENT
