SUMMARY:Ukrainian BBQ and Beer Festival
DESCRIPTION:Sebastopol World Friends presents an authentic Ukrainian BBQ (shashlik) and specially brewed Ukrainian beers: “Ukrainian IPA” from Crooked Goat Brewing\, and “Zelensky’s Orange Juice” from John Kreidler a special friend of SWF. There will be plentiful Ukrainian snacks\, BBQ\, vegetarian options\, beer\, wine\, and other beverages\, Ukrainian music\, and lots of fun. Proceeds support Sebastopol World Friends on-going efforts to fund renovation of a dormitory building in Chyhyryn\, Ukraine (Sebastopol’s sister city) that will house hundreds of Internally Displaced People from areas of Ukraine who have been impacted by the war there. Tickets are $75 and are all inclusive. Tickets must be purchased in advance at https://www.tickettailor.com/events/sebastopolworldfriends/2286813. For more information and ticket links go to sebastopolwf.org. Slava Ukraini!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/ukrainian-bbq-and-beer-festival/
LOCATION:Ragle Ranch Regional Park\, 500 Ragle Road\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Entertainment/Culture,Fundraiser
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ScreenShot-Tool-20260916140429.png
