SUMMARY:Ukrainian BBQ Benefit for Sister City Relief Effort
DESCRIPTION:Ukrainian BBQ and Beer Fest\nSunday\, October 4th\, 2026. 1:00pm-4:00pm\nSebastopol World Friends presents an authentic Ukrainian BBQ (shashlik) and specially brewed Ukrainian beers: “Ukrainian IPA” from Crooked Goat Brewing\, and “Zelensky’s Orange Juice” from John Kreidler a special friend of SWF. There will be plentiful Ukrainian snacks\, BBQ\, vegetarian options\, beer\, wine\, and other beverages\, Ukrainian music\, and lots of fun. Proceeds support Sebastopol World Friends on-going efforts to fund renovation of a dormitory building in Chyhyryn\, Ukraine (Sebastopol’s sister city) that will house hundreds of Internally Displaced People from areas of Ukraine who have been impacted by the war there. Tickets are $75 and are all inclusive. Tickets must be purchased in advance at https://www.tickettailor.com/events/sebastopolworldfriends/2286813. This event will sell out\, so purchase tickets soon! For more information and ticket links go to sebastopolwf.org. Slava Ukraini!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/ukrainian-bbq-benefit-for-sister-city-relief-effort/
