SUMMARY:Mend & Befriend
DESCRIPTION:The next Mend & Befriend plus clothes / fabric swap is coming up on Tuesday\, October 6 at the Sebastopol Grange from 4:30-6:30 pm. Join us for a relaxing time of mending\, crafting and socializing. All ages welcome.
