SUMMARY:Masters of Hawaiian Music: George Kahumoku Jr\, Led Kaapana\, Jeff Peterson
DESCRIPTION:Experience the soulful sounds and rich traditions of Hawai‘i with three legendary masters of slack key guitar—George Kahumoku Jr.\, Led Kaapana\, and Jeff Peterson. \nRooted in the 19th-century paniolo (Hawaiian cowboy) culture\, slack key is a uniquely Hawaiian open-tuning guitar style passed down through generations. These three acclaimed musicians bring together decades of tradition\, storytelling\, and virtuosic musicianship.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/masters-of-hawaiian-music-george-kahumoku-jr-led-kaapana-jeff-peterson/
LOCATION:390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
