SUMMARY:Sebastopol Carbon Conversation - Reducing Food Waste
DESCRIPTION:Reducing Food Waste \nFood Waste is a major\ncontributor to Greenhouse\nGas Emissions worldwide. \nAt this Carbon Conversation\nwe’ll learn about local\nefforts to reduce waste\nthroughout the food cycle\,\nfrom farm to table. \nEnjoy FREE “STONE SOUP”!\n Vegan\n Local surplus veggies\n Local Bread\n Served at 6pm \nLearn more and RSVP at www.rahus.org/scc
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/sebastopol-carbon-conversation-reducing-food-waste/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Grange\, at 6000 Sebastopol Rd/Hwy 12\, sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly)
