SUMMARY:Laguna Lab Supper Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a supper club at the awesome emerging arts space\, Laguna Lab. \nWe envision a monthly space for community\, connection\, dialogue\, delicious local thoughtfully-prepared food\, and a spotlight on one of the many local organizations/ collectives doing important culture repair work. This month we will be hearing from ReVillage\, the visionaries behind Graton Station and the Graton Town Square\, who will share about the care-filled work of cultivating belonging in the places we live. Their partner organization\, the Preservatory\, will be providing a wonderful meal.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/laguna-lab-supper-club/
LOCATION:Laguna Lab\, 117 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults only, 21 and older,Civic,Community Forum,Dinner Show,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/supperclub.jpg
END:VEVENT
